@startuml
!include ../common/style.puml

title HANBAY HOTEL - AI Room Recommendation

autonumber

actor Guest
boundary "Web Application" as Web
control "AI Recommendation API" as API
control "AI Recommendation Service" as AIService
control "Availability Service" as Availability
control "Spring AI ChatClient" as ChatClient
database "Hotel Database" as DB
participant "LLM Provider" as LLM

Guest -> Web: Enter preferences,\nbudget and stay information
Web -> API: Request room recommendation
API -> AIService: recommend(request)

activate AIService

AIService -> Availability: searchAvailableRoomTypes(criteria)
Availability -> DB: Load available room types\nand calculated prices
DB --> Availability: Trusted room data
Availability --> AIService: Available options

alt No available rooms
    AIService --> API: No recommendation
    API --> Web: Empty result
    Web --> Guest: Suggest changing dates
else Available rooms exist
    AIService -> AIService: Build constrained prompt\nusing trusted backend data
    AIService -> ChatClient: Request structured recommendation
    ChatClient -> LLM: Generate recommendation
    LLM --> ChatClient: Structured result
    ChatClient --> AIService: Recommendation DTO

    AIService -> AIService: Validate room type against context
    AIService -> DB: Save AI request and response log
    DB --> AIService: Log saved

    AIService --> API: Recommendation result
    API --> Web: Recommended room and explanation
    Web --> Guest: Display recommendation
end

deactivate AIService

note over AIService, LLM
The AI may only recommend from backend-provided rooms.
It does not determine availability or create bookings.
end note

@enduml
